{"id":"wb-7-1557","name":"新乡文庙大观圣作之碑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"新乡文庙大观圣作之碑","text":"新乡文庙大观圣作之碑位于中国河南省新乡市红旗区人民政府、原新乡县文庙内。\n这是中国现存的数块大观圣作之碑之一。1986年11月，河南省人民政府公布新乡县文庙为第二批河南省文物保护单位。2013年3月，此碑以新乡文庙大观圣作之碑之名，被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位，分类为“石窟寺及石刻”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E4%B9%A1%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%82%E5%9C%A3%E4%BD%9C%E4%B9%8B%E7%A2%91","revisionId":91277173,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91277173","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8267b46e10112adf4796f7d1.jpg","title":"20241006_Stele_of_the_Daguan_Emperor's_Work_at_Xinxiang_Confucian_Temple_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241006_Stele_of_the_Daguan_Emperor%27s_Work_at_Xinxiang_Confucian_Temple_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/20241006_Stele_of_the_Daguan_Emperor%27s_Work_at_Xinxiang_Confucian_Temple_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​新乡文庙大观圣作之碑","width":320,"height":480}}